{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18271","headline":"去岁自刑部侍郎以罪贬潮州刺史乘驿赴任其後家亦谴逐小女道死殡之层峰驿旁山下蒙恩还朝过其墓留题驿梁 · 韩愈","name":"去岁自刑部侍郎以罪贬潮州刺史乘驿赴任其後家亦谴逐小女道死殡之层峰驿旁山下蒙恩还朝过其墓留题驿梁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数条藤束木皮棺，草殡荒山白骨寒。\n惊恐入心身已病，扶舁沿路衆知难。\n绕坟不暇号三帀，设祭惟闻饭一盘。\n致汝无辜由我罪，百年慙痛泪阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}